        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana DSM125, Magnetic Dome Door Stop</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThere are 2 main sections to the magnetic door stop. The 1-3/8\" high dome style base section has a permanent magnet on the face. It is mounted to the floor with the included base, anchors and screws. The magnet is spring-loaded to absorb shocks. The 1\" diameter round holder section is screwed to the door for the magnet catch to hold it in the open position. The Solid Brass Magnetic Dome Door Stop is of brass and available in 9 different finish colors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-DSM125-specifications.gif?v=1704354652\" width\"600\" height=\"165\" border=\"0\" atl=\"Magnetic Dome Door Stop Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/stainless-steel-magnetic-dome-door-stop-deltana-dsm125u32x\"><b>Stainless Steel Magnetic Dome Door Stop</b></a>\r\n<br>\r\nAlso see our <a href=\"/pages/magnetic-door-stops-and-holders\"><b>Magnetic Door Stops</b></a> tech page for more information and ideas.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Deltana DSM125 Magnetic Door Stop:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Base Height: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Base Width: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Holder Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with mounting hardware.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DSM125.pdf?v=1704262186\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana  DSM125 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNote: Regardless of the finish choice, these are made of solid brass. \r\n</p>",
