                "title": "Solid Brass Magnetic Dome Door Stop",
                "description": "Magnetic Dome Door Stop, Deltana DSM125 - There are 2 main sections to the magnetic door stop. The 1-3/8 inch high dome style base section has a permanent magnet on the face. It is mounted to the floor with the included base, anchors and screws. The magnet is spring-loaded to absorb shocks. The 1 inch diameter round holder section is screwed to the door for the magnet catch to hold it in the open position. The Solid Brass Magnetic Dome Door Stop is of brass and available in 9 different finish colors.",
